response objects exposing .isError() and .registers -- while this part alone could be wrapped, it is moot given the transport 
gap above.
    - minimalmodbus has no 'unit' keyword concept per-call (slave address is bound to the Instrument instance), requiring 
restructuring of ModbusIO's per-call unit parameterization -- another sign of a deeper architectural mismatch beyond glue-code
scope.

